<title>CANADA: Kingsway Financial to file C$41.1 mln issue.</title>
<headline>Kingsway Financial to file C$41.1 mln issue.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingsway Financial Services Inc said on Wednesday it received clearance to file its final prospectus for a C$41,125,000 public offering of common shares in Canada.</p>
<p>Kingsway Financial said the offering consists of 1.5 million treasury shares and 250,000 shares from the secondary offering by Intercargo Corp, Kingsway Financial's largest shareholder, priced at C$23.50 per share for total proceeds of C$41,125,000.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
